      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاحَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A place of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوْح</span> [or <i>wailing for a dead
person</i>]: (Msb:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاحَاتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاوِحُ</span>. (A, L.)
Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنَّا فِى مَنَاحَةِ فُلَانٍ</span> [<i>We were in the place
of wailing of,</i> or <i>for, such a one</i>]. (S, K.) ― 
